 },
 "tests": "All on HEAD 06761db20 unless named. pnpm --filter @objectstack/cli typecheck: exit 0 (tsc --noEmit; --listFiles shows the new test in that program; check:test-typecheck OK). Unit: pnpm --filter @objectstack/cli exec vitest run --project unit --maxWorkers=2 gave 290 passed and 2 PREREQUISITE ('packages/cli is not built'); after pnpm --filter @objectstack/cli build, those 2 files (published-subpath-console.pin, published-subpath-hook-body.pin) passed, 29 tests. So 292/292 files and 4354 tests (4325 passed + 29 skipped, plus the 29 rerun). Integration: --project integration on the new pin + schema-migrate.host-composition, organization-ownership-not-declared, organization-ownership-apply.served-catalog, unmanaged-tables, schema-migrate.requires-providers, schema-migrate.deferred-ddl gave 'Test Files 7 passed (7) / Tests 35 passed (35)'; the rest of the integration tier is left to CI. Pin before the fix (base 7e6e4e1da): 'Tests 1 failed | 2 passed (3)', AssertionError expected 'blocked' to be 'done'. Ablation on 6088127b0 via node scripts/ablation-replace.mjs --delete of the install call: anchor x1 to x0, blob 7dac64a970ff to bf8f5b76bc9e, pin red ('expected blocked to be done', 1 failed | 2 passed); restored with blob == HEAD 7dac64a970ff, git diff HEAD empty, status clean. No dist step was needed: the mutated file is in the package under test and is reached through relative src imports. Dialect: SQLite only.",
